<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21070] Update enforced sessions for master reviews</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21070</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I'm reviewing the test configs for master reviews (passing rates can be seen here: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_matrix" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_matrix&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The el9 enforced review-dne-part-x are split between el9.7 and el9.8; part-2, 4 and 5 are still running with el9.7. The issues with part 4 and 5 appear to be resolved as the passing rates are 90+%.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;part-2 failures should be resolved by &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68662" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68662&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Once the part-2 patch is merged, OK to remove el9.7 review-dne-part-x sessions and enforce el9.8?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;review-dne-zfs-part-5 is running with el9.7 still. The el9.8 version is passing with 92%.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;OK to remove the el9.7 review-dne-zfs-part-5 session and use el9.8?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For the el10 sessions, el10.2 review-dne-part-x and review-dne-zfs-part-x sessions are passing with 90+%.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;OK to enforce el10.2 review-dne/dne-zfs sessions and remove el10.1 sessions?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Other sessions to enforce:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-reviews-el10.2-x86_64-review-dne-ipv6 - 94%&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-reviews-el9.8-x86_64-rocky9.8-aarch64-review-ldiskfs-arm - 87%&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-reviews-el9.8-x86_64-review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-1 - 94%&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lustre-reviews-el8.10-x86_64-el10.2-x86_64-review-ldiskfs - 96%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
