                            <comment id="504787" author="JIRAUSER19288" created="Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:04:15 +0000">&lt;p&gt;On the three questions, I don't have an objection. When that patch is landed, it seems fine. However, I'm not aware of a reason why the 9.7 and 10.1 groups were kept longer, other than specific failures that seem to be resolved now. &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adilger" class="user-hover" rel="adilger"&gt;adilger&lt;/a&gt; , do you have any objections?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The number of optional test runs isn't great but expected. I suppose for the last 30 days the sample size is good enough.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
